     3290   if   Make-Excel Then  do:   Output stream ForExcel close.   assign   number-list = number-list + 1   .   os-delete value( v-excel-file + ".":U + string(number-list)).   Output Stream ForExcel to value( v-excel-file + ".":U + string(number-list ) ) . end.
     3291   FInd first Sheetf where
